      <p>Sources consulted 9 October 2026. Continue with the <a href="/transcription-desk/reading/">single-witness workshop</a>, <a href="/seminars/02-philology-and-translation/">translation seminar</a>, or <a href="/academy/reading-the-evidence/">documentary capstone</a>.</p>
    </div>
